OL,3,GNEWSAStrongwoman sets sights on US
OL,4,Aafter setting records
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Bradford weightlifter with cerebral
OL,7,Fpalsy has said she is "excited" to take
OL,8,Fon her next challenge after setting two
OL,9,Fworld records at a disabled strongwoman
OL,10,Fcontest.
OL,12,FAlana Walker, 34, from Allerton, set
OL,13,Frecords for seated sandbag and axle
OL,14,Fdeadlift at the GB Disabled World
OL,15,FRecord Day event at Iron Island in Bury
OL,16,FSt Edmunds on 12 July.
OL,18,FWalker lifted 51.5kg (113.5lb) in the
OL,19,Fsandbag-to-shoulder lift and 201.4kg
OL,20,F(444lb) in the axle deadlift - despite
OL,21,Ffacing heatwave conditions.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
