OL,3,GNEWSAStrongwoman sets sights on US
OL,4,Aafter setting records
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe will next compete in September's
OL,7,FStatic Monsters World Championships in
OL,8,FPhoenix, Arizona, and said she was
OL,9,F"excited, confident and a little bit
OL,10,Fnervous".
